---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Notice | Immigration Glossary"
  description="Privacy and analytics information for gringo.bingo."
>
  <article class="privacy-notice">
    <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>

    <p><em>Last updated: October 14, 2026</em></p>

    <h2>About this website</h2>
    <p>
      gringo.bingo is an independent, publicly accessible
      English-Spanish immigration terminology reference.
      It is not affiliated with any government agency.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      This website uses Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand
      how visitors use the glossary, including which pages are
      visited, how visitors find the website, and general
      usage patterns.
    </p>

    <p>
      Analytics is optional. Google Analytics is not loaded
      unless you choose to accept analytics cookies.
      You can decline without losing access to any part
      of the website.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you accept, Google Analytics may collect information
      about your device, browser, approximate geographic location,
      pages visited, and interactions with the website.
      Google may process this information according to its
      own privacy practices.
    </p>

    <p>
      For more information, see
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">
        Google's Privacy Policy
      </a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and preferences</h2>
    <p>
      If you accept analytics, Google Analytics may place
      cookies on your device to help distinguish visits.
      If you decline, the website does not load Google Analytics.
    </p>

    <p>
      Your analytics preference is stored locally in your
      browser so you do not have to make the same choice
      every time you visit.
    </p>

    <p>
      You can change your choice using the
      <strong>Privacy settings</strong> button on the website.
      Withdrawing consent stops further analytics collection
      and removes the standard Google Analytics cookies
      accessible to this website.
    </p>

    <h2>Other information</h2>
    <p>
      The website is hosted using GitHub Pages. Like other
      web-hosting services, GitHub may process technical
      information associated with requests to the website.
      See
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">
        GitHub's Privacy Statement
      </a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you submit a suggested glossary edit through an
      external service, information you provide may be
      processed by that service according to its own policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
    <p>
      This notice may be updated when the website's
      features or data practices change.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>